      "summary": "Evidence summary: 6 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "The central loop follows classic survival horror: explore an interconnected mansion, manage limited inventory and resources, solve item and environmental puzzles, and decide when combat is worth the risk.",
          "sentiment": "positive",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 3,
